Author: Weiqun Zhang <weiqunzhang@lbl.gov>
Date:   Wed Jun 17 18:40:01 2026 -0700

    FFT: support R2C on non-cell-centered MultiFabs (#5495)
    
    Previously, the real-valued input and output MultiFabs for R2C had to be
    cell-centered. They may now be nodal in any direction.
    
    For nodal inputs, the terminal nodal point in each nodal direction is
    not used by the FFT. For nodal outputs, the terminal nodal point is
    filled with the periodically shifted value from the lower end.

