Author: Weiqun Zhang <weiqunzhang@lbl.gov>
Date:   Tue May 5 09:47:43 2026 -0700

    GitLab CI: scope GitHub App credentials to status job (#5394)
    
    Attach the GitHub PR status notification job to a dedicated
    github-status environment so GitLab variables can be scoped to that job.
    
    This prevents the GPU build/test jobs, which check out and execute
    GitHub PR code, from receiving the GitHub App private key or
    installation token material. Normally this should not matter, but a
    maintainer-triggered PR could still modify CMake or test code that runs
    inside those build jobs, and that code must not be able to read the
    GitHub App credentials.

