    Robustify AMREX_ASSUME (#5254)
    
    The issue is the implementation based on if-else is not a single
    statement. So code like below does not work.
    ```
        if (foo)
            AMREX_ASSUME(bar);
        else
            std::cout << "else\n";
    ```
    
    The new implementation based on do-while(0) fixes this issue.

