commit a404d91be3f960308fa2419e8b4f45fbea3e7d95
Author: David Gardner <gardner48@llnl.gov>
Date:   Thu Feb 26 12:09:15 2026 -0800

    Fix impicit MRI configuration calls (#5093)
    
    ## Summary
    
    Corrects `Set` function calls to configure the slow integrator with an
    implicit MRI method. This addresses the issues noted in #5044. The calls
    changed from `ARKStep` to `MRIStep` would work with SUNDIALS 7.1.0 or
    newer (when stepper specific `Set` functions were deprecated and
    replaced with common `ARKode` functions) but would fail with earlier
    versions of SUNDIALS.
    
    Correct `Set` functions calls to configure an implicit fast integrator
    in an MRI method to use a fixed-point solver, modify the max number of
    iterations, or set the linear solver when using a Newton solver.

Src/Extern/SUNDIALS/AMReX_SundialsIntegrator.H

