commit 477c09f1098f639185d2e6bb595068a4dee1cf4c
Author: Alexander Sinn <64009254+AlexanderSinn@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Wed Dec 3 22:53:56 2025 +0100

    Add amrex::Gpu::freeAsync (#4804)
    
    This PR adds the function `amrex::Gpu::freeAsync (Arena* arena, void*
    mem)` that can be used to free memory the next time the current GPU
    stream is synchronized.
    
    This is based on #4432 but with much reduced complexity from OMP.
    The interface is now opt-in and always available, instead of needing to
    be enabled using runtime parameters.

