commit 8cfb8b67cf06ff8a22f156c4af66e57b22f8e8a7
Author: Weiqun Zhang <weiqunzhang@lbl.gov>
Date:   Fri Aug 8 12:13:49 2025 -0700

    Add ParallelForOMP (#4595)
    
    ParallelFor does not do any OMP threading, because we do coarse-grained
    OMP threading at the MFIter level with tiling. But there are cases we
    use ParallelFor outside MFIter and they could benefit from OMP
    threading. Thus, we add new ParallelForOMP functions in this PR. Note
    that OMP threading is used only for CPU builds with OMP, otherwise the
    new ParallelForOMP functions are equivalent to ParallelFor functions.
    
    ---------
    
    Co-authored-by: Andrew Myers <atmyers2@gmail.com>

