Date:   Wed May 21 13:19:58 2025 -0700

    Add new amrex::Initialize (#4476)
    
    In #4463, MPI data types were removed from the global namespace in
    non-MPI builds. This broke several codes. Some codes use
    `MPI_COMM_WORLD` when calling amrex::Initialize because that was the
    recommended way of modifying the default ParmParse parameters. In this
    PR, we add a new amrex::Initialize that allows the users to modify
    ParmParse parameters without providing an MPI Communicator.

