commit cf1d056ae157ccc25891da7e273082c0ee53951a
Author: Zhi Chen <62574124+zhichen3@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Thu May 8 13:21:48 2025 -0400

    add conservative linear interpolation for spherical 2d geometry (#4441)
    
    this adds conservative linear interpolation for spherical 2d geometry.
    It calculates `xoff` and `yoff` in "volume" space. For xoff, its the
    same as spherical 1d. For yoff, it uses cosine as weighting factor,
    since cell volume in spherical geometry $\propto (\cos(\theta_r) -
    \cos(\theta_l)) (r_r^3 - r_l^3)$

