    ReduceToPlaneMF (#4384)
    
    Add a new Reduce to plane function that returns the results in a pair of
    MultiFabs. The first MultiFab is distributed the same as the original
    data MultiFab with each Box flatten to 1 cell. The Fabs of the first
    MultiFab contain box-local reduction results. The second MultiFab has
    only a single cell in the reduction direction, and it contains global
    reduction results distributed in the other two directions.

