    FFTPoissonSolverDirichlet::SolvePoissonEquation()    3000     0.4731     0.4752     0.4797   2.32%
    Fields::InitializeSlices()                           1000     0.4426     0.4504     0.4597   2.22%
    Fields::ShiftSlices()                                1000     0.2872     0.3431     0.4128   1.99%
