Author: Max Katz <maxpkatz@gmail.com>
Date:   Mon Apr 8 12:00:17 2024 -0400

    Allow plotting only a subset of Amr levels (#2825)
    
    If the user would like to limit plotfile size on disk, they can plot
    only a subset of the levels -- this should still be an accurate (though
    lower resolution) representation of the fluid state since the state is
    averaged down at the end of the timestep.
    
    fcompare is also updated to allow comparing between plotfiles with
    different numbers of levels.

