Author: Weiqun Zhang <weiqunzhang@lbl.gov>
Date:   Sat Feb 10 12:33:50 2024 -0800

    GNU Make: Link flags (#3711)
    
    The link information returned by mpich may include some compiler flags
    like `-fallow-argument-mismatch -g`. On Mac, this causes an issue for
    the clang based linker because `-fallow-argument-mismatch` is a gfortran
    flag. So we need to filter them out.

