Author: Weiqun Zhang <weiqunzhang@lbl.gov>
Date:   Sun Oct 8 11:32:13 2023 -0700

    BCType::ext_dir_cc (#3581)
    
    Add a new BC type `BCType::ext_dir_cc` to address the issue in #3580.
    For cell conservation interpolation, the boundary location for
    `BCType::ext_dir` is on the domain face. Applications assuming boundary
    location at cell centers can now use `BCType::ext_dir_cc`.
    
