commit 65ba959170fb2f29c3cd6e641b01a2ac208e1233
Author: Weiqun Zhang <weiqunzhang@lbl.gov>
Date:   Mon Jun 12 12:42:20 2023 -0700

    CMake: AMReX_TEST_TYPE (#3357)
    
    Add a new option, AMReX_TEST_TYPE=[All|Small]. Be default, all tests are
    built when AMReX_ENABLE_TEST is on. When the type is small, only four
    tests are enabled. If a CI job takes too long to compile and run all the
    tests, we could switch to the small test type.
    
    Re-enable tests and change the test type to Small for the nvhpc CI. We
    had to disable it due to space limit in. It should no longer be a
    problem for the small set of tests.

