Author: Weiqun Zhang <weiqunzhang@lbl.gov>
Date:   Fri Jun 2 17:03:34 2023 -0700

    CMake: Link option when HIP is a language (#3335)
    
    ## Summary
    
    Although HIP is treated as C++ in AMReX CMake, we should add the link
    options `-Xoffload-linker --whole-archive -fgpu-rdc` when the link
    language is HIP, not just CXX. Otherwise, an AMReX application code that
    treats HIP as a CMake supported language will not get those flags.
    
    ## Additional background
    
    https://github.com/xsdk-project/xsdk-examples/issues/50
    
    ## Checklist
    
