commit 2f47d132d71c49abbeac5e081fe9ce886c621d54
Author: Luca Fedeli <luca.fedeli@cea.fr>
Date:   Wed Apr 12 21:40:31 2023 +0200

    Add powi function in AMReX_Math.H (#3251)
    
    ## Summary
    This PR adds a replacement of `std::pow` (`powi`) that is intended to be
    used when the exponent is integer and known at compile time. If fast
    math optimizations are not enabled, `powi` can be one order of magnitude
    faster than `std::pow`.
    
    ## Additional background
    Adding this function to `AMReX_Math.H` was discussed with @WeiqunZhang
    and @ax3l in https://github.com/ECP-WarpX/WarpX/pull/3824
    
    ## Checklist
    
    The proposed changes:
