commit d8bc97f92a1a568b6e996db3b8d9715fced0464f
Author: Ben Wibking <ben@wibking.com>
Date:   Sun Nov 13 12:39:58 2022 -0500

    min/max- and linear combination-preserving interpolater (#3020)
    
    ## Summary
    This linearly interpolates onto fine grids, ensuring no new minima and
    maxima are created in multi-dimensions and also preserving linear
    combinations of components in each cell.
    
    The current implementation is only for Cartesian geometry.
    
    ## Additional background
    `CellConservativeLinear` can do each of these things separately (i.e.,
    `CellConservativeLinear(0)` or `CellConservativeLinear(1)`), but does
    not preserve both of these properties at the same time.

